OL,3,GNEWSASurvivor 'still haunted' by blast
OL,4,A75 years later
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was an explosion so powerful that
OL,7,Fsome people thought Bristol had been
OL,8,Fbombed.
OL,10,FIn 1951, eight-year-old Pete Simons was
OL,11,Fstanding outside a garage when a fuel
OL,12,Ftank exploded, killing 11 people. Some
OL,13,Freports suggest the death toll was even
OL,14,Fhigher.
OL,16,FThe blast ripped through part of Ashley
OL,17,FRoad in St Pauls, leaving buildings
OL,18,Fdamaged and the street strewn with
OL,19,Frubble.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
