OL,3,GNEWSASurvivor 'still haunted' by blast
OL,4,A75 years later
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, 75 years later, he is sharing his
OL,7,Fstory in the hope the victims of what
OL,8,Fhe calls Bristol's "forgotten" disaster
OL,9,Fare not lost to history.
